---
// BeP02DeleteRetry: added in the figure pass. Red = the part the reader owns or the failing path.
---
<figure class="bep2j">
  <div class="bep2j-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 228" role="img" aria-label="State diagram. Case 14 exists. The first DELETE answers 204 No Content and case 14 is gone. A retried DELETE answers 404 Not Found and case 14 is still gone. The answer differs but the state is the same.">
<rect x="20" y="60" width="240" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
<text x="140" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>case 14 exists</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vụ 14 còn đó</tspan></text>
<rect x="330" y="60" width="240" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
<text x="450" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>case 14 gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vụ 14 đã mất</tspan></text>
<rect x="640" y="60" width="240" height="64" rx="10" class="boxr" />
<text x="760" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="tt"><tspan data-lang-en>case 14 gone</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vụ 14 đã mất</tspan></text>
<path d="M 262 92 L 320.0 92.0" class="ln" /><polygon points="326,92 317.9,95.9 317.9,88.1" class="hd" />
<path d="M 572 92 L 630.0 92.0" class="lnr" /><polygon points="636,92 627.9,95.9 627.9,88.1" class="hdr" />
<text x="294" y="56" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>DELETE</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>DELETE</tspan></text>
<text x="294" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>204 No Content</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>204 No Content</tspan></text>
<text x="604" y="56" text-anchor="middle" class="bb"><tspan data-lang-en>DELETE again</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>DELETE lần nữa</tspan></text>
<text x="604" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>404 Not Found</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>404 Not Found</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="20" text-anchor="middle" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>a timeout forces the client to retry the delete</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một cú timeout buộc client retry lệnh xoá</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="208" text-anchor="middle" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>a different answer, the same state — idempotency is about the state left behind</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>câu trả lời khác, trạng thái vẫn vậy — idempotency nói về trạng thái để lại</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The retried DELETE gets a different answer and leaves the same state. That is all idempotent has ever meant.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>DELETE retry nhận câu trả lời khác nhưng để lại cùng trạng thái. Idempotent chỉ có nghĩa vậy thôi.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
